  "description": "⭐ <em>Don’t miss the Paddington Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Tour, a Paddington-themed tour through London aboard a classic double-decker bus, brought to you by Brigit’s Bakery, renowned for its delightful afternoon tea experiences. Enjoy sweet treats, marmalade sandwiches and animated storytelling while passing the city’s most famous landmarks.</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>🎄Don’t miss the festive adventure! Experience London’s iconic Christmas lights with the Paddington™ Christmas Lights Bus Tour—book your tickets</strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/598780?thm=12314\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong> here.</strong></a><strong>🎄</strong><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🚌 Ride through Central London aboard an iconic Routemaster double-decker bus<br>\n🍰 Enjoy a Paddington-themed afternoon tea with the famous marmalade sandwich<br>\n🐻 Discover London landmarks with animated storytelling from Paddington and Mrs Bird<br>\n📍 Spot highlights like Big Ben, Westminster Abbey, Piccadilly Circus and more<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Paddington™ Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Tour <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/646730\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 30 minutes&nbsp;<br>\n📍 <strong>Departure: </strong><strong>8 Northumberland Avenue, WC2N 5BY, outside the Grand Hotel&nbsp;</strong><br>\n👤 Age requirement: 5+<br>\n❗<strong>&nbsp;Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com&nbsp;</strong>❗<br>\n♿ Accessibility: please refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FAQs</a><br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/paddington-afternoon-tea-bus-tour\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nClimb aboard a charming double-decker Routemaster for a Paddington-themed afternoon tea tour through Central London. Enjoy a delightful menu featuring marmalade sandwiches while passing iconic landmarks such as Big Ben, Westminster Abbey and Piccadilly Circus. Built-in screens bring the journey to life with animated storytelling from Paddington and Mrs Bird, making it a bear-tastic experience for families and London lovers alike. Get your tickets today for the <em>Paddington Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Tour</em> in London!<br>\n<br>\n© P&amp;Co.&nbsp;Ltd./SC&nbsp;2026<br>\nLicensed on behalf of Studiocanal S.A.S by Copyrights Group",
